{"1905400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rodent Rumble", "steam_appid": 1905400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Us on Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/26edc6787d0f9ac2aff03a8fa6ad2a4d.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1560 height=446 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>CHAOTIC TERRITORY CLASHES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These suburbs belong to YOU! Gather the squad, hold your territory, and take out the enemy's burrow before they destroy yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d863a6efd3b75c8b6699e821fe4c3bb3.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d863a6efd3b75c8b6699e821fe4c3bb3.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d863a6efd3b75c8b6699e821fe4c3bb3.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE THROUGH THE SEASONS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all rodents are built the same. Conquer seasonal events and outperform the other team to ensure your burrow survives the harsh climate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/31d9bc65f57f96d0a2b5ff63b04d3e35.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/31d9bc65f57f96d0a2b5ff63b04d3e35.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/31d9bc65f57f96d0a2b5ff63b04d3e35.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CRITTER</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your rodent's outfit with a plethora of stylish clothing, patterns, and fur colors. Earn currency to unlock these cosmetics by playing and performing well in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/42620b37e25d5c89a35ec82d1ea9cf41.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/42620b37e25d5c89a35ec82d1ea9cf41.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/42620b37e25d5c89a35ec82d1ea9cf41.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SCAVENGE FOR THE BESTEST LOOT</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ransack houses, smash garbage bins, and wreak havoc across the neighborhood to gather loot and scraps for your team. Don't forget to snag bonus goodies from taking out those pesky hoarder raccoons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/28edcb078f29f238fe3886fa1fa08f68.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/28edcb078f29f238fe3886fa1fa08f68.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/28edcb078f29f238fe3886fa1fa08f68.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>LEVEL UP &amp; OVERPOWER YOUR FOES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devour scraps, deal damage, and earn KO's to gain XP and upgrade your character. Level up quickly and choose power-ups to give you an edge over your rodent counterparts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d055ef23e3d5420dc466bfe2b355cf5a.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d055ef23e3d5420dc466bfe2b355cf5a.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d055ef23e3d5420dc466bfe2b355cf5a.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>COOL FEATURES:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple classes with unique gameplay styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of destructible objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Events from Pizza Parties to Nuclear Missile launches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-Player Target Break Mode and corresponding Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance Emotes, Sprays, and Emoji expressions usable in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Nameplates and player Titles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skydiving Squirrels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/f33275a2edb3388da05de77868a100cb.avif?t=1776830529\" width=168 height=168 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>CHAOTIC TERRITORY CLASHES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These suburbs belong to YOU! Gather the squad, hold your territory, and take out the enemy's burrow before they destroy yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d863a6efd3b75c8b6699e821fe4c3bb3.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d863a6efd3b75c8b6699e821fe4c3bb3.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d863a6efd3b75c8b6699e821fe4c3bb3.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE THROUGH THE SEASONS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all rodents are built the same. Conquer seasonal events and outperform the other team to ensure your burrow survives the harsh climate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/31d9bc65f57f96d0a2b5ff63b04d3e35.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/31d9bc65f57f96d0a2b5ff63b04d3e35.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/31d9bc65f57f96d0a2b5ff63b04d3e35.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CRITTER</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your rodent's outfit with a plethora of stylish clothing, patterns, and fur colors. Earn currency to unlock these cosmetics by playing and performing well in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/42620b37e25d5c89a35ec82d1ea9cf41.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/42620b37e25d5c89a35ec82d1ea9cf41.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/42620b37e25d5c89a35ec82d1ea9cf41.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>SCAVENGE FOR THE BESTEST LOOT</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ransack houses, smash garbage bins, and wreak havoc across the neighborhood to gather loot and scraps for your team. Don't forget to snag bonus goodies from taking out those pesky hoarder raccoons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/28edcb078f29f238fe3886fa1fa08f68.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/28edcb078f29f238fe3886fa1fa08f68.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/28edcb078f29f238fe3886fa1fa08f68.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>LEVEL UP &amp; OVERPOWER YOUR FOES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devour scraps, deal damage, and earn KO's to gain XP and upgrade your character. Level up quickly and choose power-ups to give you an edge over your rodent counterparts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d055ef23e3d5420dc466bfe2b355cf5a.poster.avif?t=1776830529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d055ef23e3d5420dc466bfe2b355cf5a.webm?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/d055ef23e3d5420dc466bfe2b355cf5a.mp4?t=1776830529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>COOL FEATURES:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple classes with unique gameplay styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of destructible objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Events from Pizza Parties to Nuclear Missile launches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-Player Target Break Mode and corresponding Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance Emotes, Sprays, and Emoji expressions usable in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Nameplates and player Titles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skydiving Squirrels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/extras/f33275a2edb3388da05de77868a100cb.avif?t=1776830529\" width=168 height=168 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Assemble your squad and mark your territory in Rodent Rumble! Level up, scavenge, and scrap with other rodents in a chaotic, all-out team vs. team scuffle to conquer the neighborhood!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/f50855fcd22ca1adb7ec908d6b8547f7fdbbc96b/header.jpg?t=1776830529", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/839be7f3225fb81e346e224dbe1d8f6938668d36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776830529", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905400/839be7f3225fb81e346e224dbe1d8f6938668d36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776830529", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 2GB / AMD Radeon R7 370 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 3GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas